    svc_eye:"Service", svc_h:"Air conditioner maintenance & repair", svc_sub:"We care for your unit after installation — so it runs quietly, efficiently and lasts for years.",
    svc1t:"Cleaning & disinfection", svc1p:"Indoor unit wash, antibacterial treatment, cleaning of filters and the heat exchanger.",
    svc2t:"Refrigerant refill", svc2p:"Pressure check, R32/R410 top-up, leak detection and repair.",
    svc3t:"Diagnostics & repair", svc3p:"Fault diagnosis, replacement of boards, sensors, fans and compressor with a workmanship warranty.",
    svc4t:"Seasonal service", svc4p:"Full service before summer or winter. For business — under contract with scheduled visits.",
    svc_note:"Prices are indicative. The final cost is quoted by the technician after inspection — no hidden fees.", svc_btn:"Order service",
    pay_eye:"Payment", pay_h:"Flexible payment: instalments, credit or after installation", pay_sub:"Get your air conditioner now — pay the way that suits you.",
    pay1h:"Pay in instalments", pay1p:"Split the amount into convenient monthly payments right in the app. Approval in minutes.", pay1t:"up to 12 payments · 0% from store",
    pay2h:"Pay in instalments", pay2p:"Instalments via terminal or Privat24 on popular air conditioner models.", pay2t:"up to 24 months",
    pay3l:"Cash / card", pay3h:"Pay after installation", pay3p:"Cash, card or transfer — only after you confirm everything works.", pay3t:"no prepayment",
    pay4l:"For business", pay4h:"Bank transfer", pay4p:"VAT invoice, full document package and closing acts for legal entities.", pay4t:"VAT · documents",
    rev1:"We ordered a 9000 BTU TCL for the bedroom. Delivered and installed the same day, neatly, cleaned up after. They charged only after start-up. Very happy.",
    rev2:"We got a heat pump for a large room. The manager honestly recommended a model for the area, didn't push pricier options. Heats great in winter. Recommend.",
    rev3:"They quoted the price right away and fixed it, no hidden fees. Certified installers worked on the 7th floor. All clean and fast. Thanks for the service!",
    faq_eye:"FAQ", faq_h:"Frequently asked questions", faq_sub:"Answers to what people ask most often.",
    faq:[["Will I know the final price before work starts?","Yes. On the phone a specialist clarifies all details and gives the cost. Before starting, the installer fixes the price on the receipt. We stand for transparent pricing — no hidden charges."],
      ["Do I need to pay anything before installation?","No. Payment for the unit and installation comes only after acceptance in working order. Exception — if it's below −10°C outside, the check moves to the next warm day."],
      ["Will you prepare documents for high-rise work for the building management?","Yes, we prepare the full document package in advance. Our specialists hold industrial climber certificates. For each site we issue a work permit."],
      ["What if I don't like the installation result?","Before starting, the lead installer agrees all details with you. If the result doesn't match what was agreed — you pay nothing. That's our quality guarantee."],
      ["Can the unit be installed during or after renovation?","Yes. Installation is done before, during or after renovation. We also do it in 2 stages — concealed during renovation and finished afterwards."],
      ["What's the difference between an inverter and a regular AC?","An inverter compressor adjusts power smoothly — saves up to 30% energy, quieter, longer lifespan. A regular (On/Off) one switches fully on and off — simpler and cheaper, but less efficient."],
      ["How do I choose the capacity for my room?","Simple rule: 1 kW of capacity per 10 m². For a 25 m² room — 2.5 kW (9,000 BTU). Use our size guide above or call us — a specialist will factor in ceiling height, windows and orientation."]],
    con_eye:"Contacts", con_h:"Visit us or give us a call", con_sub:"TEXNO PLAZA store — Sumy, Kharkivska St. 2/1.",
    con_card:"Get in touch", con_phone:"Phone", con_addr:"Address", con_hours:"Working hours", con_addr_val:"Sumy, Kharkivska St. 2/1, TEXNO PLAZA store",
    con_hours_val:"Mon–Fri 10:00–18:00 · Sat 10:00–17:00",
